author: "harness:claude-code"
resolution: "Parsed env's grammar for the interpreter check, and added a per-prefix map of options that consume the next word for the wrapper walk, so an operand is never read as the program in either place."
expected_result: "A genuine shell script behind env options is scanned, and an option's operand is never mistaken for a spawning wrapper."
actual_result: "env -u FOO bash answered not-shell so the file left the scan entirely, and env -u parallel npm --version was audited as a possible publish."
